{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"詩篇","commonName":"詩篇","title":"詩篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"459b5a4b12b2ca0929884c296e82479f990b5c49c76874f4a699afa4e3d9e703","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2449},"chapter":{"number":32,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["認罪與赦免"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["大衛的訓誨詩。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"過犯得到赦免、罪惡被遮蓋的人有福了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不被耶和華算為有罪、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心裡沒有詭詐的人有福了！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我默然不語、拒絕認罪的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就因整日哀歎而身心疲憊。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的手晝夜重壓我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的精力如水在盛夏枯竭。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"我向你承認自己的罪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再隱瞞自己的惡。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我說：「我要向耶和華承認我的過犯。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你就赦免了我的罪惡。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"因此，趁著還能尋求你的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"願所有敬虔的人都當向你禱告；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"洪水氾濫時，必不殃及他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你是我的藏身之所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你保護我免遭危難，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用得救的樂歌環繞我。（細拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：「我要指教你走正路；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要勸導你，看顧你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要像無知的騾馬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不用嚼環轡頭就不馴服。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"惡人必多遭禍患，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的慈愛必環繞信靠祂的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"義人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要靠耶和華歡喜快樂；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心地正直的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們都要歡呼。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/32.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/33.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PSA/31.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}